<section class="av_toggle_section av-m8dsqt60-399d8d3601552177688c71cb392251cb" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Is the Super Human Protocol safe, and are there any side effects?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Is the Super Human Protocol safe, and are there any side effects?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Is the Super Human Protocol safe, and are there any side effects?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-4" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Is the Super Human Protocol safe, and are there any side effects?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-4" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Is the Super Human Protocol safe, and are there any side effects?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-4" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-4" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>Yes, our health, mind, and body wellness protocol is generally safe for individuals of any age. Each protocol component, PEMF, EWOT, and Photobiomodulation, is non-invasive and painless. However, as with any therapy offered by Casa Privee, it’s advisable to consult with <a href="about-bankole-johnson.php">Dr. Johnson</a> before starting, especially if you have pre-existing health conditions.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-m8dssfhi-770432ebf57ae19d227b75d076a4acb1" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Why is the specific sequence of therapies important in the Super Human Protocol?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Why is the specific sequence of therapies important in the Super Human Protocol?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Why is the specific sequence of therapies important in the Super Human Protocol?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-5" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Why is the specific sequence of therapies important in the Super Human Protocol?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-5" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Why is the specific sequence of therapies important in the Super Human Protocol?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-5" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-5" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>The effectiveness of this full-body wellness system offered by Casa Privee lies in its structured approach, where each technology builds upon the other. PEMF prepares the body, enhancing cellular function and improving circulation. Following this, EWOT becomes more effective, delivering oxygen more efficiently to tissues and organs. Finally, Photobiomodulation capitalizes on this enhanced state, promoting optimal light absorption and oxygen uptake. This sequential approach helps reverse oxidative stress and optimize energy production in the body.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-m8dstxqz-e7870cf0d534ff1d1c56e1343cb2b335" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: How long does each session take, and how many sessions are needed to see results?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: How long does each session take, and how many sessions are needed to see results?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: How long does each session take, and how many sessions are needed to see results?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-6" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="How long does each session take, and how many sessions are needed to see results?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-6" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">How long does each session take, and how many sessions are needed to see results?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-6" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-6" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>A typical session generally lasts around 60 minutes, although the exact duration may vary depending on individual health needs and goals. The number of sessions required to see results can vary based on individual health goals and conditions. Some individuals may experience benefits after a few sessions, while others might require more to achieve optimal results.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
